{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"Where is this..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Motoki City. </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto's</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> place."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="3">Goto's</STYLE>...?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Sleeping on the futon laid out in the living room was </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\春花白装束バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Haruka-chan<STYLE ID="2">.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\なつみ32バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">Beside her, watching over </STYLE>Haruka-chan<STYLE ID="2"> with a worried look, was </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物3" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\五島横顔32.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "100" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">Beside me, casting a doubting look at the two of them, was </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">It seemed that, right now, all our hearts were pulling in different directions.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYMOVIE "モニターノイズ.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "100" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n100\r\n500\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{PLAYSND "SE\sceneswitch2.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\五島マンションエントランスインターホン.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2,人物3" "14" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n100\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">When I got to the entrance, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> was trying to lift </STYLE>Haruka-chan<STYLE ID="2">, who had collapsed in front of the intercom.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\なつみ横顔32.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1">, hang in there!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">! Let's carry </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1"> upstairs! Come on!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"But..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\なつみ32バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE>Haruka's<STYLE ID="1"> your daughter too, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">!? </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, if I collapsed, would you just ignore me!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">If I or </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> turned </STYLE>Haruka-chan<STYLE ID="2"> away, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> would surely leave with </STYLE>Haruka-chan<STYLE ID="2">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Either way, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> was going to end up with </STYLE>Haruka-chan<STYLE ID="2">.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\五島マンションリビング夜.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\五島横顔32.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Hm?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"I'm a little relieved. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Maybe my deduction is wrong. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">No, I want it to be wrong."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Yes..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Even as she said so, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto-chan's</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> expression was still stiff.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Just then, </STYLE>Haruka-chan<STYLE ID="2"> turned toward us.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\春花白装束バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"<STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE>... <STYLE ID="4">Auntie</STYLE>..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"It's been a long time, </STYLE>Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="3">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Natsumi's</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> greeting had been different; </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto-chan's</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> was a reunion greeting with little feeling in it.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Haruka-chan<STYLE ID="2"> looked away awkwardly as well.</STYLE><PG>
"Sorry... for disappearing all this time..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">After that, the silence went on.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">What on earth are we supposed to talk about?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I want to hug </STYLE>Haruka-chan<STYLE ID="2"> with joy―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">this time, at last, I want to hold her, and yet this distrust is hard to wipe away.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\なつみ32バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Hey, </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1">, is that white outfit the only thing you've got on?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Ah, yeah... ever since I got here, for some reason I've been in these clothes the whole time."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"For some reason...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Uh... 
{PAUSE ""}
there's tons I want to ask, but everyone's got tons they want to ask too, right...?"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物3" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\五島バストアップ32.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Then could you tell us how you got here?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yeah, all right."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,人物2,人物3" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"I'll never forget it. Shiyo 800, April 8―"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\警笛とざわめき_2.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\人質カラー.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"I got carried off by <STYLE ID="5">Mom</STYLE> on the roof of the apartment building, right?
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\荒田集落イメージ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
　So we went to the Arata settlement, and I spent about 2 years there.
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYMOVIE "桜山頂.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "100" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n100\r\n1000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\元木市遠景.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n100\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
But when I came to, I was under a big cherry tree."<PG>
"The sky was pure white, and cherry blossoms were falling like snow. 
{PAUSE ""}
I had no idea why I'd suddenly shown up in a place like that, or even where it was. 
{PAUSE ""}
Not knowing what was going on, I tried walking around the area, but..."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\足跡.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"While I was walking, I found a building I recognized.
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\ザッハ外観.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
It was Zahha."<PG>
"I thought maybe this was Motoki-cho, and I'd somehow come back by some fluke. 
{PAUSE ""}
I was happy, but... 
{PAUSE ""}
when I quietly <STYLE ID="6" RUBY="のぞ">peeked</STYLE> into Zahha through the window..."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\死体1溶けてる.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"Inside Zahha, there was a woman dissolving a dead body. 
{PAUSE ""}
And she was filming it on her phone like she found it fascinating. 
{PAUSE ""}
This really wasn't the Motoki-cho I knew. 
{PAUSE ""}
I got scared and ran away from Zahha. 
{PAUSE ""}
I was walking all over with nowhere to go. And then―"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYMOVIE "桜山頂.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "100" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n100\r\n1000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\五島マンション外観.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n100\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"And then I saw the woman who'd been dissolving the body take someone I knew―
{PAUSE ""}
that is, <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE>, into this building. 
{PAUSE ""}
At last there was somebody alive, at last I'd get to see <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE>. 
{PAUSE ""}
But that woman who'd been dissolving the body was with her. 
{PAUSE ""}
I was uneasy about whether it'd be all right to see <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE>."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n1000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\五島マンションリビング夜.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\春花白装束バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"I went back and forth a lot, but I had nowhere else to go. 
{PAUSE ""}
So I worked up the nerve and pressed the intercom."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">The woman who'd been dissolving the body was, without a doubt, me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Seen from the outside, it might well have looked like black magic.</STYLE><PG>
"Haha... I never guessed that woman was you, <STYLE ID="4">Auntie</STYLE>..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\五島バストアップ32.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE>Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="3">, I'd like to celebrate our reunion, but I still have things to ask."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Figured... Ask me anything."<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"I'll start with the most recent events. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Why did you collapse in front of the intercom?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"That's... 
{PAUSE ""}
I don't know either. 
{PAUSE ""}
When I pressed this room's number, I suddenly started blacking out..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"This room's number?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\春花腰に手1白装束.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Yeah. I didn't know the room number, so I went down the line pressing them one by one while looking at the numbers on the mailboxes. 
{PAUSE ""}
This room was the last one."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"I see. I was wondering how you knew our room number. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Also, weren't you cold dressed like that?"</STYLE><PG>
"Cold...?
{PAUSE ""}
　I thought it was cold, but thanks to these clothes it wasn't enough to freeze."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Didn't you run into a woman dressed the same way?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"A woman dressed the same...?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"This person."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
