"............
{PAUSE ""}
............?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Furrowing her brow, she kept staring at the screen.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Isn't that </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">your mother, Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Hearing that, </STYLE>Haruka-chan<STYLE ID="2"> brought her face even closer to the screen.</STYLE><PG>
