{PAUSE ""}
But... 
{PAUSE ""}
that's impossible..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Haruka-chan<STYLE ID="2"> clenched her fists tight.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Because my <STYLE ID="5">mom</STYLE>...
{PAUSE ""}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
died a long time ago..."<PG>
