{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"That time, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> jumped from the 5th-floor roof while carrying </STYLE>Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="3">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Then she got into a car fast enough to slip past everyone's eyes and fled. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Being able to move like that means―"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"So </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Mifuyu</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> did use Droga that time after all."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Moving that impossibly must have put a huge strain on her body. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Her bones and muscles, and probably even her internal organs, can't have been normal. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="3">, with the sole aim of getting you to the Arata settlement, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> wore her life away."</STYLE><PG>
