<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE>Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="3">, what's the last thing you remember?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　From the sound of it, you were in the Arata settlement the whole time, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yeah, that's right. In the Arata settlement, there's a rite of passage just for women called <STYLE ID="7" RUBY="さんろう">the mountain seclusion</STYLE>."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "111" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\雪山.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"Women, being physically weak, shut themselves away in the mountains for a year to gain the strength of warriors who can protect the Arata settlement."<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"A year...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I was <STYLE ID="8" RUBY="へきえき">fed up</STYLE> with my own weakness. 
{PAUSE ""}
All kinds of incidents happened because of me, right?
{PAUSE ""}
　So, and this was my own call, I'd decided to do the mountain seclusion for twice as long, 2 years. 
{PAUSE ""}
Not long after <STYLE ID="5">Mom</STYLE> died, I started the mountain seclusion."<PG>
"The last thing I remember is... 
{PAUSE ""}
April 8 of Shiyo 802, when it had been almost 2 years since I started the seclusion. 
{PAUSE ""}
Even during the seclusion I counted the days, so I'm sure of it. 
{PAUSE ""}
That day was exactly <STYLE ID="5">Mom's</STYLE> third-year memorial service, right?
{PAUSE ""}
　So I went down to the settlement for a bit to see whether the memorial service was being held properly."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "111" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家昼.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
