<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"A mummy?"</STYLE><PG>
"At the Niimura main house, there was a strange mummy <STYLE ID="9" RUBY="くる">wrapped</STYLE> in a Noh mask and red robes. 
{PAUSE ""}
I looked it over a bit, and it was probably the mummy of a girl missing one eye. 
{PAUSE ""}
While I was examining the mummy, I somehow started blacking out... 
{PAUSE ""}
That's my last memory."
