<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">How to put it... the conversation just wasn't meshing.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">For a while now, what she'd been saying hadn't added up, in time or in place.</STYLE><PG>
