{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Haruka-chan's<STYLE ID="2"> story was several hours behind us, and all that time </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> had been holed up in her workroom.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Did you figure anything out?"</STYLE>
