{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="3">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> took out her notepad.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Apart from handling images and video, it seemed she still used a notepad after all.</STYLE>
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
<PG>
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\渦巻くシナプス.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="3">"First, regarding </STYLE>Niimura-senpai's<STYLE ID="3"> time slip, I think it's 'in </STYLE>Niimura-senpai's<STYLE ID="3"> own mind.'"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"In </STYLE>Haruka-chan's<STYLE ID="4"> own mind?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\五島バストアップ32.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"For example, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, you were in prison for 15 years. What did you think when you came to Motoki City?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Let me see... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Giant cherries aside, a lot of tall buildings had gone up."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"I think something similar happened to </STYLE>Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="3">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Something similar for me and </STYLE>Haruka-chan<STYLE ID="4">...?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Put simply, either </STYLE>Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="3"> has no memory of the past 13 years, </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">or she was unconscious for 13 years. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
Senpai<STYLE ID="3"> said it was when she saw the mummy, so probably at that moment."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"So that's why it's 'in </STYLE>Haruka-chan's<STYLE ID="4"> own mind.' </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">And so it looked as if she'd slipped through time."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Yes, but... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">for that, I think </STYLE>Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="3"> is too young. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Sure enough</STYLE>, Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="3"> looks only about 20, just as she says. When she's actually 33 this year. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">So I tried a different angle."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\五島うつむき32.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">At that point, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> opened her laptop.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
