{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">On the screen was something like a thin thread.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"This is a fiber from the clothes </STYLE>Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="3"> is wearing."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Come to think of it, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> had wanted fibers from the white robes </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Mifuyu</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> had been wearing.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Even checking the soles of our shoes, she apparently couldn't collect any fibers from </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Mifuyu's</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> robe.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Just as I thought, this was a mycelium with the same DNA as the goshinboku. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">A relative of the dark honey fungus, Armillaria ostoyae."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"The dark honey fungus?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\キノコイメージ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Honey fungi are perfectly ordinary mushrooms, even edible. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">But they're strongly parasitic fungi that occasionally grow to giant size. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">That doesn't contradict the giant cherries this time or the Nanashina Incident. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Presumably, it has the property of parasitizing humans and controlling them. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Here's my hypothesis."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"In Shiyo 802, </STYLE>Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="3"> was parasitized by the Arata cherry for some reason and lost consciousness for 13 years. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">And she was in a state like so-called cold storage, where even her body didn't age. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Then this time, the giant cherries appearing in Motoki City woke </STYLE>Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="3"> up, and that brings us to now."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"In other words, I think the Arata settlement and Motoki City are linked underground by the Arata cherry, and </STYLE>Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="3"> was brought here."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Wait a minute. Even if you say the Arata settlement and this place are connected, how?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">　They're 100 km apart even in a straight line, aren't they?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Relatives of the dark honey fungus grow to giant size under certain conditions. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">The one that's been found so far lives in Oregon, in America, and spreads its mycelium underground across an area of 9 square km. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Even stretching its mycelium to Motoki City in a straight line isn't an unthinkable figure, given enough time."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"In other words, if we think about the trick behind </STYLE>Niimura-senpai's<STYLE ID="3"> time slip and teleportation, the Arata settlement and the goshinboku are connected, and by some method it kept </STYLE>Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="3"> asleep without aging and moved her underground."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"You mean it dug an underground passage and sent </STYLE>Haruka-chan's<STYLE ID="4"> body through it?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">　Digging a hole 100 km long without anyone noticing?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"I don't know whether </STYLE>Niimura-senpai's<STYLE ID="3"> body was sent through as it was. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">But, and this is the same theory as the teleportation you often see in sci-fi movies, if there were a way to copy the elementary-particle information that makes up </STYLE>Senpai's<STYLE ID="3"> body and reconstruct it in Motoki City, there'd be no need to dig a big hole."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Wait a minute, are we suddenly talking about future science?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"No, this theory has already been demonstrated at a university in the Netherlands."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\ノートPC.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Strictly speaking, it isn't movement but a method of copying the elementary-particle information at the origin onto elementary particles at the destination. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">So if there's organic matter in Motoki City that can make up a human being, then in theory it's possible to teleport someone from the Arata settlement."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">It's a method so outlandish it's hard to picture, but in theory, it's possible.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"But there are things I don't understand. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Why did the Arata cherry connect the Arata settlement and Motoki City? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">And why did </STYLE>Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="3"> need to appear? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">In other words, I can form a hypothesis about the situation, but the purpose isn't clear."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Surely it's about killing anyone who's learned the secret of the Arata cherry or the goshinboku..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Yes, that's the only sticking point. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
Senpai<STYLE ID="3"> is someone I could welcome with all my heart if she really came here knowing nothing, but..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"So it's possible </STYLE>Haruka-chan<STYLE ID="4"> is lying. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">But seeing the way </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> is..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="11"> nodded instead of answering.</STYLE><PG>
Haruka-chan<STYLE ID="2"> would be easy to doubt and drive off somewhere.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">But </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> wouldn't allow that.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">And I don't want to do something like that to the </STYLE>daughter<STYLE ID="2"> I've been reunited with, either.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"And one more thing that bothers me is the existence of </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
Niimura-senpai's<STYLE ID="3"> story, if it's true, means a corpse is moving around. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">A person who should be dead is walking around, looking no different from a normal person."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"So we really can't let our guard down yet."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"For my part, I'd still like to wait for tomorrow. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">When the special unit gets here, what will </STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="3"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> do?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Then </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> folded up the laptop and stood.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\五島マンションリビング夜.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\五島バストアップ32.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Even supposing </STYLE>Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="3"> is something harmful, she shouldn't do anything right away. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Otherwise, there'd be no need to worm her way in with us in such a roundabout way. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">For now, please get some good rest for tomorrow."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"You're right. If she wanted to kill the people who survived, she'd have done it already. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">But there's no telling what will happen tomorrow. I'll turn in for tonight."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Um, are you really going to sleep on the living-room sofa? We have another guest room."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Sorry to be selfish, but I carried all the supplies into that room earlier. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">I don't much like leaving them out in the living room."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"I don't mind that, but please don't push yourself. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Well then, good night."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内ドア開閉.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> went straight back to her own room.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Tomorrow, something is going to happen.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">The cherries that suddenly appeared, and </STYLE>Haruka-chan<STYLE ID="2">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">The government, which must know the truth, and the special unit.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I have to get myself in shape for tomorrow.</STYLE>
